            "_type": "block",
            "children": [
              {
                "_key": "2f542a58346a",
                "_type": "span",
                "marks": [],
                "text": "As a consultant, I was leading the product and design team as well as overseeing the product development. In the past 2 years working on this project I built the design system and all the new product experience. I also had the chance to code a significant part of the new structure we built on Expo."
              }
            ],
            "markDefs": [],
            "style": "normal"
          }
        ]
      },
